  "keyFeatures": [
    "Full OneBot 11 standard implementation over NTQQ",
    "Multiple network transport modes: HTTP server, HTTP client (webhook), WebSocket server, WebSocket client, SSE",
    "Built-in WebUI for login management and runtime configuration",
    "Rich extended API beyond OneBot 11 standard (emoji reactions, AI voice, QQ Zone, group albums, file flash-transfer, etc.)",
    "Plugin system with auto-registration for custom actions",
    "TypeScript monorepo with napcat-core, napcat-onebot, napcat-protocol, napcat-framework, napcat-shell packages",
    "Cross-platform: Windows, Linux, macOS; Docker image available",
    "Packet-level backend for low-level QQ protocol access (nc_get_packet_status, send_packet)"
  ],
